WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:11.658
Hi! How many seconds does it take to run a lap? How long is a film from start to end? Today we'll meet seconds and work out durations.

2
00:00:11.808 --> 00:00:19.410
A second is a very short time. The second hand goes round once in 60 seconds, which is 1 minute.

3
00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:22.578
One clap takes about 1 second.

4
00:00:22.728 --> 00:00:32.946
How many seconds is 2 minutes 15 seconds? 2 minutes is 120 seconds, plus 15 is 135 seconds.

5
00:00:33.096 --> 00:00:38.322
Also remember: 1 hour is 60 minutes.

6
00:00:38.472 --> 00:00:47.778
A show runs from 9:40 to 11:15. How long is it? First count from 9:40 to 10:00: 20 minutes.

7
00:00:47.928 --> 00:00:51.474
Then from 10:00 to 11:00 is 1 hour.

8
00:00:51.624 --> 00:00:56.442
Finally, from 11:00 to 11:15 is 15 minutes.

9
00:00:56.592 --> 00:01:04.938
Add them up: 1 hour, plus 20 and 15 minutes, makes 1 hour 35 minutes.

10
00:01:05.088 --> 00:01:12.498
Watch out! Some pupils subtract as if an hour had 100 minutes. That gives a wrong answer!

11
00:01:12.648 --> 00:01:20.562
An hour has only 60 minutes. The best way is to count on to the next hour, then whole hours, then the minutes left.

12
00:01:20.712 --> 00:01:27.282
From 9:40 to 11:15 is 1 hour 35 minutes.

13
00:01:27.432 --> 00:01:35.826
Your turn! How many seconds are in 3 minutes? Pause and think.

14
00:01:35.976 --> 00:01:42.570
3 times 60 is 180 seconds. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:51.954
Another one! How long is it from 7:20 to 8:05? Pause and think.

16
00:01:52.104 --> 00:02:02.778
7:20 to 8:00 is 40 minutes, and 8:00 to 8:05 is 5 minutes. That's 45 minutes. Did you get it right?

17
00:02:02.928 --> 00:02:13.746
Here's another! It starts at 3:50. What time is it 45 minutes later? Pause and think.

18
00:02:13.896 --> 00:02:23.946
10 minutes after 3:50 is 4:00, with 35 minutes to go. So it's 4:35. Did you get it right?

19
00:02:24.096 --> 00:02:34.698
Here's another! It ended at 5:10 and took 40 minutes. When did it start? Pause and think.

20
00:02:34.848 --> 00:02:44.754
Count back: 10 minutes before 5:10 is 5:00, and 30 more minutes back is 4:30. Did you get it right?

21
00:02:44.904 --> 00:02:54.858
Last one! What time is it 1 hour 25 minutes after 10:50? Pause and think.

22
00:02:55.008 --> 00:03:05.634
1 hour later is 11:50. 10 more minutes is 12:00, with 15 left, so it's 12:15. Did you get it right?

23
00:03:05.784 --> 00:03:16.218
Remember: 1 minute is 60 seconds and 1 hour is 60 minutes. For durations, count on to the next hour, then whole hours, then the minutes left.

24
00:03:16.368 --> 00:03:21.906
Today, work out how long it is from the end of school to dinner!

